Read-only historical evidence. Billing v2 first appears at 575e2b2; 9b14229 is the PR merge-base.
Both snapshots close active leases by assigning LastSettledAt and ClosedAt to the same close instant. Their terminal withdraw branch already accepted imported lagging cursors and finalized the entire interval independent of payment.
The v2 static validator required nonzero ClosedAt but did not require cursor equality; block-time validation separately prohibited future timestamps. This establishes historical import compatibility, not the contents of deployed state.

